{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半部左侧第一段米白色粗体大字最先吸引视线；下方第二段字号、亮度和醒目程度相近，随后分走主视线。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"只隐约抓到仍在为过去的事情不服气、心里较劲；具体处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、难受；两种情绪的变化关系不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"如今已经不在那些人身边；自我较劲耗尽力气后，不服气逐渐淡去，想到彼此分离才感到难受。第一段还补充了不敢多想过去开心的事。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两段大字同样醒目，主视线容易在两块之间切换。\",\n    \"两段都是较长复句，各自包含多层意思，仅扫关键词难以确定完整处境。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上下两块，需要拼接过去的不服气、如今的疲惫、与那些人的分离以及难受之间的关系。\",\n    \"中间多组较小短语横向排列，需要在场景词和情绪词之间筛选。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "411d6a6a-7d26-4d58-809d-10b21f5a9e6e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T032840974481Z", "elapsed_seconds": 49.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:29:30.552081+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "77fbff24340daf841486f2c7ed3b6ab84db96919f2c1e0c6301fa50a3aef1bbb", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f66